WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.127
It is easy to draw an imidazopyridine with an elegant

00:00:05.127 --> 00:00:08.869
substituent. Making and identifying the compound is the

00:00:08.869 --> 00:00:10.273
first real examination.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:20.308
Organic synthesis begins with an intended structure. A

00:00:20.308 --> 00:00:24.166
spectrum and an isolated sample decide what the

00:00:24.166 --> 00:00:25.613
reaction actually yielded.

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:34.945
The UREP research investigated imidazopyridine

00:00:34.945 --> 00:00:38.439
chemistry, using synthetic strategies and

00:00:38.439 --> 00:00:41.934
characterization to develop candidate heterocycles.

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:50.160
Chemical purity and structural assignment must precede

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:53.340
confidence in a biological screening result.

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:04.782
Cytotoxicity readouts are starting points for

00:01:04.782 --> 00:01:07.558
investigating molecular activity; they cannot

00:01:07.558 --> 00:01:10.890
demonstrate anticancer efficacy in a patient.

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:19.824
Microwave synthesis, spectroscopy and a cell assay

00:01:19.824 --> 00:01:24.163
answer different questions. Activity in a screen is not

00:01:24.163 --> 00:01:26.091
proof of anticancer efficacy.

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:35.986
The project record should preserve which compounds were

00:01:35.986 --> 00:01:39.523
made, what assays were performed, and which conclusions

00:01:39.523 --> 00:01:40.407
remain untested.

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:49.672
A useful medicinal-chemistry story follows each

00:01:49.672 --> 00:01:53.432
evidentiary step without jumping from structure to

00:01:53.432 --> 00:01:53.969
treatment.
